function scanWorkflowButton(scan){if(!scan.cloudAssetId)return'';const map={assign:['assign','Assign Asset'],return:['return','Return Asset'],transfer:['transfer','Transfer Asset'],maintenance:['repair','Mark for Repair'],retire:['disposal-request','Retire Asset']},entry=map[scan.scanMode];if(!entry||!window.mdmCanAction?.(entry[0]))return'';return '<button data-asset-action="'+entry[0]+'" data-asset-id="'+esc(scan.cloudAssetId)+'">'+entry[1]+'</button>'}
